<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2JN" style="id">- Rufumbira New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 YOHAANA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Urwandiko rwa kabiri rwanditswe na YOHAANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 YOHAANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Yoh</para>
  <para style="mt2">URWANDIKO RWA KABIRI RWANDITSWE NA</para>
  <para style="mt1">YOHAANA</para>
  <para style="imt">INYANZURO</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Urwandiko rwa kabiri rwanditswe na Yohaana</char> Umukuru w'itoorero arwandikira umubyeyi akunda hamwe n'abaana be. Bishoboka ko umwanditsi yamenyeeshaga itoorero hamwe n'abayoboke baaryo. Ubutumwa buri muri uru rwandiko muri make ni ugushiishiikariza abantu gukundana no kubihanangiriza kwirinda abiigiisha bibinyoma n'inyigiisho zaabo.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ibirimo</para>
  <para style="io1">Inyanzuro <char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:1-3">1:1-3</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Urukundo n'urw'ibanze <char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:4-6">1:4-6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kwihanangiriza abantu ku ibyerekeye inyigiisho z'ibinyoma <char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:7-11">1:7-11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Umusoozo <char style="ior"><ref loc="2JN 1:12-13">1:12-13</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="s">Indamutso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Njeewe Mukuru w'itoorero, ndakwandikiye umubyeyi watooranyijwe hamwe n'abaana baawe bo nkunda by'ukuri. Nyamara si nje njenyine ahuubwo n'abo boose baazi ukuri barabakunda, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />kuko ukuri kuguma muri twe kandi kuzaahora muri twe iteeka ryose.<verse eid="2JN 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Ubuntu, imbabazi n'amahoro biva ku Maana Daata no ku Mwana waayo Yesu Kristo, bibaane naatwe mu kuri no mu rukundo.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukuri hamwe n'Urukundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Narishimye caane gusanga bamwe mu baana baawe bagendera mu kuri nk'uko Daata yabidutegetse. <verse eid="2JN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yoh 13:34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:12">15:12</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 15:17">17</ref>.</char></note>Noone reero, mubyeyi, ndagusaba kugira ngo twese dukundane. Iri si itegeko risha nkwandikira ahuubwo ni iryo dusanganywe. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Urukundo mvuga, ni ukubaho dukurikiza amategeko y'Imaana. Iri ni ryo tegeko mwumviise kuva mbere na mbere kandi mukwiriye kurikurikiza.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Abiigiisha b'ibinyoma bamaze kugwira mu isi, abo bateemera ko Yesu Kristo yaje mu buryo bw'umubiri. Umuntu weese umeze atyo ni umunyabinyoma kandi ni urwanya Kristo. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Mube maaso kugira ngo mutaaza gupfiirwa ibyo twakoreye, ahuubwo muzaahaabwe ingororano zaanyu mu bwuzuye.<verse eid="2JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Umuntu weese uteemera inyigiisho za Kristo ahuubwo akazirengaho, aba adafite Imaana mu mutima we. Naho umuntu weemera izo nyigiisho, uwo ni we ufite ubumwe n'Imaana Daata n'Umwana. <verse eid="2JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Nihagira ubaazaaho atazanye inyigiisho za Kristo, ntimuzamwakire iwaanyu. Ntimuzaanamubwire muti, “Ni amahoro,” <verse eid="2JN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />kuko uwaakiira umuntu nk'uwo aba afatanyije na we mu mirimo ye mibi.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umusoozo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Nuubwo mfite byinshi byo kubandikira, sinshatse kubibamenyeesha nkoreesheje urupapuro n'ikaramu ahuubwo niringiye ko nzaaza nkavugana namwe amaaso ku yandi, kugira ngo umunezeero waacu wuuzure.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Abaana ba mwene nyoko watooranyijwe baragutaasha.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>